{"seq":3,"slug":"graph-quality-metrics-review-loop","title":"图谱质量度量、去重去噪与人工审核闭环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/knowledge-graph-ontology-linked-data-engineering/entity-resolution-graph-quality/graph-quality-metrics-review-loop","wordCount":2804,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"图谱质量度量-去重去噪与人工审核闭环\">图谱质量度量、去重去噪与人工审核闭环</h1><p>一条跨境电商商品图谱总会在某个时刻向运维发出同一个问题：「这条 <code>:BluetoothHeadphone</code> 到底有没有 <code>gtin</code>？」图谱不是建完就好的一次性产物——抽取流水线每天从供应商 feed、平台 API、报关单里灌入新三元组，实体解析（见 <a href=\"entity-resolution-modeling-blocking\">实体解析建模与阻塞</a>）与本体对齐（见 <a href=\"ontology-matching-entity-alignment\">本体匹配与实体对齐方法</a>）每天都在新增 <code>owl:sameAs</code>。<strong>质量度量</strong>回答「现在的图有多可信」，<strong>去重去噪</strong>回答「怎么把已知的坏数据清掉」，<strong>人工审核闭环</strong>回答「边界情况由谁、按什么顺序、依据什么标准来判」——它们缺一不可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-质量维度与可计算指标\">核心概念：质量维度与可计算指标</h2><p>质量不是一个标量，而是一组互相拉扯的维度。Wang 与 Strong 在 1996 年的《Beyond Accuracy》（<em>JMIS</em>）里把数据质量拆成 15 个维度、4 大类，核心结论是**「质量 = 适合使用」（fitness for use）**。Zaveri 等人的综述《Quality Assessment for Linked Data》（<em>Semantic Web Journal</em>，<a href=\"https://www.semantic-web-journal.net/content/quality-assessment-linked-data-survey-1\">https://www.semantic-web-journal.net/content/quality-assessment-linked-data-survey-1</a>）把这套框架专门化到关联数据，给出 18 个维度与 69 个可计算指标，是目前 RDF 图谱质量的事实参考模型。</p>\n<p>跨境商品图谱里真正会驱动决策的是其中六个维度，每个都能写成可执行查询：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>可计算指标</th>\n<th>跨境商品图示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整性 completeness</td>\n<td>必填槽位填充率、<code>sh:minCount</code> 违反数</td>\n<td>有多少 SKU 缺 <code>gtin</code> / <code>hsCode</code> / 原产国</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性 consistency</td>\n<td>约束违反率、推理机发现的不可满足类</td>\n<td>同一 SKU 两条 <code>gtin</code> 冲突、类归属矛盾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>准确性 accuracy</td>\n<td>与权威源（GS1、海关税则）的比对不符数</td>\n<td>HS 编码与商品描述不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简洁性 conciseness</td>\n<td>冗余三元组占比、重复实体数</td>\n<td>同一供应商十几个 <code>owl:sameAs</code> 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时效性 timeliness</td>\n<td>事实年龄分布、超期未刷新比例</td>\n<td>停用 HS 编码仍在使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可信度 trustworthiness</td>\n<td>带出处（PROV）的三元组占比</td>\n<td>无法追溯来源的断言占比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标必须<strong>绑定口径与阈值</strong>才有治理价值。「完整性 92%」本身无意义——要说明它是对哪个类、哪些必填属性、用哪个 shape、在哪个时间窗算出来的。一个常见的完整性度量是对某类 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的必填属性集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>：</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>comp</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mtext>type</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>∧</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi>o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mtext> </mtext><mtext>hasValue</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>:</mo><mtext>type</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{comp}}(C) = \\frac{|\\{(e,p) : \\text{type}(e, C) \\wedge p \\in P \\wedge \\exists o.\\,\\text{hasValue}(e, p, o)\\}|}{|P| \\cdot |\\{e : \\text{type}(e, C)\\}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">type</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">type</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hasValue</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|P| \\cdot |C|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是关键：只数「有值的槽位」会漏掉整类为空的情况，而后者恰恰是最危险的静默失败。</p>\n<h2 id=\"shacl-校验与推理-把-不一致-变成可断言的失败\">SHACL 校验与推理：把「不一致」变成可断言的失败</h2><p>质量维度要落地，必须把业务期望翻译成<strong>机器可判、可回归</strong>的断言。W3C 的 <strong>SHACL</strong>（2017-07-20 成为 Recommendation，<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/</a>）正是这个角色：用 <code>sh:NodeShape</code> / <code>sh:PropertyShape</code> 描述目标节点的约束，用 <code>sh:minCount</code>、<code>sh:datatype</code>、<code>sh:pattern</code>、<code>sh:class</code>、<code>sh:sparql</code> 表达规则。例如「每个商品必须有唯一 GS1 标识」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"turtle\" data-code=\"ex:ProductShape a sh:NodeShape ;&#10;  sh:targetClass ex:Product ;&#10;  sh:property [ sh:path ex:gtin ;&#10;                sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;&#10;                sh:pattern &quot;^[0-9]{13}$&quot; ] .\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ex:ProductShape a sh:NodeShape ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sh:targetClass ex:Product ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  sh:property [ sh:path ex:gtin ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sh:pattern \"^[0-9]{13}$\" ] .</span></span></code></pre></div><p>校验产出 <code>sh:ValidationReport</code>，<code>sh:conforms</code> 是布尔结论，每个违规可定位到 <code>sh:focusNode</code>。这让<strong>一致性从主观判断变成一条可回归的期望</strong>：shape 进 git，每次数据变更跑一遍，违反数就是质量指标。选 SHACL 还是 <strong>ShEx</strong>（<a href=\"https://shex.io/\">https://shex.io/</a>）主要看生态——SHACL 是 W3C 标准、校验器更全，ShEx 在高性能与递归形状上更优。</p>\n<p>SHACL 管的是<strong>形状层的封闭世界约束</strong>；<strong>OWL 推理管逻辑一致性</strong>。把本体当公理集喂给推理机（HermiT、ELK、Konclude），能发现比 shape 更深的问题：把两个不相交类（<code>owl:disjointWith</code>）的实例判为 <code>owl:sameAs</code>，推理机会报不可满足类；把 <code>owl:FunctionalProperty</code> 属性赋了两个不同值，则逻辑矛盾。对齐结果正是这类矛盾的高发来源——所以质量校验<strong>必须排在对齐之后</strong>，这也是 <a href=\"ontology-matching-entity-alignment\">本体匹配与实体对齐方法</a> 强调「一致性校验不可省」的落点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[增量抽取&lt;br/&gt;r2rml / 抽取器] --&gt; B[实体解析与去重&lt;br/&gt;簇合并 → 规范 IRI]&#10;  B --&gt; C[SHACL 形状校验&lt;br/&gt;sh:ValidationReport]&#10;  B --&gt; D[OWL 推理一致性&lt;br/&gt;HermiT / ELK / Konclude]&#10;  C --&gt; E{质量门&lt;br/&gt;违反率 ≤ 阈值?}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E -- 通过 --&gt; F[发布到三元组库]&#10;  E -- 超阈值 --&gt; G[隔离区&lt;br/&gt;quarantine]&#10;  G --&gt; H[人工审核队列&lt;br/&gt;按下游代价排序]&#10;  H --&gt; I[判定回流&lt;br/&gt;修正 + 新 shape / 新标签]&#10;  I --&gt; B\">graph TD\n  A[增量抽取&lt;br/&gt;r2rml / 抽取器] --&gt; B[实体解析与去重&lt;br/&gt;簇合并 → 规范 IRI]\n  B --&gt; C[SHACL 形状校验&lt;br/&gt;sh:ValidationReport]\n  B --&gt; D[OWL 推理一致性&lt;br/&gt;HermiT / ELK / Konclude]\n  C --&gt; E{质量门&lt;br/&gt;违反率 ≤ 阈值?}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E -- 通过 --&gt; F[发布到三元组库]\n  E -- 超阈值 --&gt; G[隔离区&lt;br/&gt;quarantine]\n  G --&gt; H[人工审核队列&lt;br/&gt;按下游代价排序]\n  H --&gt; I[判定回流&lt;br/&gt;修正 + 新 shape / 新标签]\n  I --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"去重与去噪-两类污染-两种工序\">去重与去噪：两类污染，两种工序</h2><p><strong>去重（deduplication）<strong>针对「同一现实、多个节点」。实体解析产出 <code>owl:sameAs</code> 断言，但断言不等于清理——同一实体可能挂着十几个等价节点、各带一部分属性，查询只会返回碎片。去重要做三件事：<strong>选定簇主</strong>（canonical IRI，取数据最全、最权威的来源）、<strong>重写引用</strong>（把指向被合并节点的三元组主语/宾语改指簇主）、<strong>合并冲突</strong>。冲突里最硬的是功能属性冲突：两个被断为同一的商品各有一个不同的 <code>gtin</code>，这不是「取最新」能解决的，而是明确的错误信号，应打回审核而非静默合并。去重质量用成对精度/召回度量，但更该盯两个下游会真实感知的指标：重复率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>（冗余程度）与</strong>过度合并率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>over</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>被错误合并的规范实体</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>规范实体</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{over}} = \\frac{|\\text{被错误合并的规范实体}|}{|\\text{规范实体}|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">over</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.53em;vertical-align:-0.52em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">规范实体</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">被错误合并的规范实体</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。后者对下游是灾难级——一次误合并会把两个供应商的账款并进同一张对账单。</p>\n<p><strong>去噪（denoising）<strong>针对「三元组本身是垃圾」。常见类别可枚举：悬空引用（宾语 IRI 在图中不存在）、数据类型错误（<code>gtin</code> 写成 <code>xsd:integer</code> 而非带前导零的字符串）、字面量与 IRI 混用、完全重复的三元组、过期事实（停用编码、旧版税率）。<strong>悬空率</strong>（宾语 IRI 不在图的主语/宾语集合中的三元组占比）与</strong>孤儿节点率</strong>（无入边也无出边的节点占比）都是廉价而敏感的信号——大规模孤儿通常意味着 r2rml 映射漏配了外键。噪声清理遵循「可回退」原则：被判定为噪声的三元组进隔离区并保留出处，而不是直接删除，因为「这是噪声」本身就是一个可能出错的判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人工审核闭环-主动学习-抽检与标注一致性\">人工审核闭环：主动学习、抽检与标注一致性</h2><p>自动阈值再调也留不住灰区，落地的关键是<strong>闭环</strong>而非「审核」这个孤立动作。闭环由四段构成。</p>\n<p><strong>第一段：把审核队列排序。</strong> 队列不按入库时间排，而按<strong>不确定性 × 下游代价</strong>排。不确定性来自匹配器分数落在阈值灰区（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6 &lt; w &lt; 0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span>）、模型预测熵高、或多模型投票分歧大——即<strong>主动学习</strong>里的不确定性采样、查询委员会、margin sampling。下游代价由业务给：合并两个清关主体比合并两个推荐标签贵几个数量级。</p>\n<p><strong>第二段：用一致的方式标注。</strong> 单人标注无法度量可靠性，必须引入<strong>双盲标注 + 一致性系数</strong>。观察一致度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、按边际分布随机也能达到的期望一致度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 Cohen&#39;s kappa <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = (p_o - p_e)/(1 - p_e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa &gt; 0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 通常为强一致，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>0.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6\\text{–}0.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">0.8</span></span></span></span></span> 可接受但需复核，低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 说明<strong>任务定义本身有歧义</strong>——该修的是标注指南，不是催标注员。多标注者或含缺失标签时用 Krippendorff&#39;s <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 1 - D_o/D_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。一个常见的坑是标注者对「同一公司」定义不同（是否把分公司视为同一法人），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 因此虚低——先把定义写进指南再测一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>第三段：抽检代替全审。</strong> 全量人工审核成本随图规模线性增长，不可持续；正确做法是高置信自动、灰区人工，并对自动通过的样本做<strong>统计抽检</strong>以估计漏检率。要在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 置信度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 误差内估计比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，样本量约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = z_{1-\\alpha/2}^2 \\, p(1-p) / e^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3111em;vertical-align:-0.497em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.378em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.497em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z \\approx 1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p \\approx 0.03</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e = 0.01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1118</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx 1118</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1118</span></span></span></span></span>。抽检是<strong>唯一能在不审全部的情况下给出可信漏检率区间</strong>的手段。</p>\n<p><strong>第四段：回流。</strong> 人工判定必须写回：确认的匹配成为训练正例与新的锚点，否定的成为 cannot-link 约束，反复出错的对触发阈值或 shape 调整。没有回流审核就是纯成本；有回流，每批投入都在降低下一批的人工量。审核模式与适用边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全自动通过</td>\n<td>高置信（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>high</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w &gt; T_{\\text{high}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">high</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>漏检率无区间，靠抽检兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灰区人工</td>\n<td>中置信（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>low</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>high</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{low}} &lt; w &lt; T_{\\text{high}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">low</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">high</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>队列积压，需 SLA 与优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双盲标注</td>\n<td>校准指南、测一致性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>指南歧义使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计抽检</td>\n<td>对自动通过样本周期抽样</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>需正确算样本量与置信区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>专家复核</td>\n<td>高代价判定（清关主体、VAT）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>瓶颈，须限定范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"质量门与持续监控\">质量门与持续监控</h2><p>把上述指标固定成<strong>每次变更都过的门</strong>，质量才不依赖某次大扫除。做法是让形状、校验脚本、指标阈值全部进版本控制，在流水线 CI 里跑：SHACL 违反率、推理不可满足数、重复率、悬空率、孤儿率任一超阈值就阻断发布，把增量数据导入隔离区（对应上图的 quarantine）。同时给每个断言挂<strong>出处</strong>——用 W3C PROV-O（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-o/</a>）记录「谁、在何时、依据哪条规则/哪个源」生成了它，这既支撑可信度维度，也让出错时能按源回滚。W3C 的《Data on the Web Best Practices》（<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/\">https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/</a>）把「提供出处」「质量元数据」「版本化」列为推荐实践，正是这套门控的标准依据。</p>\n<p>监控层要盯<strong>趋势与漂移</strong>，不是单点快照：阈值卡在边界上时质量会缓慢偏移而不触发告警，因此记录每个指标的时序，对「完整性连续 N 天下降」「悬空率突变」设漂移告警。<strong>形状自身的版本管理</strong>也常被忽视：业务规则变了（新增必填的 <code>countryOfOrigin</code>），旧数据会集体不合格——正确做法是新旧 shape 并存过渡期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>三个工位合起来构成一条闭环：<strong>度量</strong>给出现状与阈值，<strong>去重去噪</strong>清理由度量暴露的已知污染，<strong>人工审核</strong>处理自动规则覆盖不到的灰区，其判定再回流为新的形状、阈值与标签。跨境场景的实践清单：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>指标绑定口径</strong>：每个质量指标必须写清维度、目标类、形状、时间窗与阈值，否则不可回归、不可追责。</li>\n<li><strong>SHACL 管形状、OWL 推理管逻辑</strong>，校验排在对齐与去重之后；形状进 git、随数据变更跑。</li>\n<li><strong>去重盯过度合并</strong>：功能属性冲突（如两条 <code>gtin</code>）打回审核，不静默取最新；去噪走隔离区保留出处。</li>\n<li><strong>审核按不确定性 × 下游代价排序</strong>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> / <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 校验标注质量，用统计抽检给出漏检率区间，判定必须回流。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>质量达标的图谱随后进入三元组库、用 SPARQL 提供服务——那是本 hub「SPARQL 查询、三元组库与图谱服务应用」一章的主题；而出处、命名空间与版本治理细节，则与 <a href=\"../kg-ontology-rdf-data-model/iri-namespace-ontology-governance\">IRI、命名空间与本体治理</a> 及 <a href=\"../kg-construction-extraction-fusion/multi-source-fusion-provenance\">多源融合与出处追踪</a> 相衔接。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图谱质量度量、去重去噪与人工审核闭环","id":"图谱质量度量-去重去噪与人工审核闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：质量维度与可计算指标","id":"核心概念-质量维度与可计算指标"},{"level":2,"text":"SHACL 校验与推理：把「不一致」变成可断言的失败","id":"shacl-校验与推理-把-不一致-变成可断言的失败"},{"level":2,"text":"去重与去噪：两类污染，两种工序","id":"去重与去噪-两类污染-两种工序"},{"level":2,"text":"人工审核闭环：主动学习、抽检与标注一致性","id":"人工审核闭环-主动学习-抽检与标注一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"质量门与持续监控","id":"质量门与持续监控"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"本体匹配与实体对齐方法：字符串、结构与知识图谱嵌入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/knowledge-graph-ontology-linked-data-engineering/entity-resolution-graph-quality/ontology-matching-entity-alignment"},"next":{"title":"SPARQL 查询语言：图模式、聚合、属性路径与联邦查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/knowledge-graph-ontology-linked-data-engineering/sparql-triplestore-serving-applications/sparql-query-language"}}